                                                <div class="se-module se-module-text"><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center " style="line-height:1.8;" id="SE-76404ba6-4c89-49a5-ba21-9c1ab9084b78"><span style="color:#000000;background-color:#f2f2f2;" class="se-fs-fs19 se-ff-nanumsquareneo  se-style-unset " id="SE-605c622e-561e-4262-b5e7-5a5f1cd436e7">참여기관</span></p>
